  3
ICE OF TOA PRIOR TO THE COMMENCEMENT OF WORK.\P7. RELEVANT SERVICES DRAWINGS ARE TO BE READ SIMULTANEOUSLY AND PROVISION OF CUTOUTS / SLEEVES TO BE PROVIDED AS REQUIRED.\P8. ALL MATERIALS / FINISHES TO BE AS SPECIFIED AND AS APPROVED BY THE CLIENT/T
  3
