  3
O BE PLOTTED TO MENTIONED PAPER SIZE.\P5. ONLY WRITTEN DIMENSIONS ARE TO BE FOLLOWED. DO NOT SCALE THE DRAWING.\P6. DIMENSIONS / LEVELS INDICATED TO BE VERIFIED AT SITE BEFORE COMMENCEMENT OF WORK, ANY DISCREPANCIES IF NOTED TO BE BROUGHT TO THE NOT
  3
ICE OF TOA PRIOR TO THE COMMENCEMENT OF WORK.\P7. RELEVANT SERVICES DRAWINGS ARE TO BE READ SIMULTANEOUSLY AND PROVISION OF CUTOUTS / SLEEVES TO BE PROVIDED AS REQUIRED.\P8. ALL MATERIALS / FINISHES TO BE AS SPECIFIED AND AS APPROVED BY THE CLIENT/T
  3
OA.9. IN CASE OF ANY VARIATION OR DEVIATION IN SPECIFICATIONS &/OR MATERIALS FROM THIS DRAWING, A PRIOR APPROVAL FROM THE CLIENT SHALL HAVE TO BE TAKEN BEFORE EXECUTING THE ITEM(S).\P10. FOR ALL THE PROJECTS WHERE THE TENDER HAS BEEN ISSUED, THIS DR
